d integration tasks\\n\"\n        \"ToolQA: Tool usage and question answering\\n\"\n        \"AiderBench: Code assistance and collaboration\"\n    )\n    \n    # Web Browsing Capabilities slide\n    slide_layout = prs.slide_layouts[1]\n    slide = prs.slides.add_slide(slide_layout)\n    title = slide.shapes.title\n    content = slide.placeholders[1]\n    \n    title.text = \"Web Browsing & Interaction\"\n    content.text = (\n        \"WebArena: Complex web navigation and task completion\\n\"\n        \"MiniWob++: Web automation and form interaction\\n\\n\"\n        \"Agents can:\\n\"\n        \"\u2022 Navigate websites and interact with UI elements\\n\"\n        \"\u2022 Fill forms and complete web-based tasks\\n\"\n        \"\u2022 Extract and process web information\\n\"\n        \"\u2022 Automate complex web workflows\"\n    )\n    \n    # General Assistance & Reasoning slide\n    slide_layout = prs.slide_layouts[1]\n    slide = prs.slides.add_slide(slide_layout)\n    title = slide.shapes.title\n    content = slide.placeholders[1]\n    \n    title.text = \"General Assistance & Reasoning\"\n    content.text = (\n        \"GAIA: General AI assistant tasks\\n\"\n        \"GPQA: Graduate-level reasoning problems\\n\"\n        \"AgentBench: Multi-domain agent evaluation\\n\"\n        \"MINT: Mathematical reasoning and problem solving\\n\"\n        \"EDA: Entity deduction and logical reasoning\\n\"\n        \"ProofWriter: Logical proof generation\\n\\n\"\n        \"Demonstrates strong reasoning and problem-solving abilities\"\n    )\n    \n    # Technical Architecture slide\n    slide_layout = prs.slide_layouts[1]\n    slide = prs.slides.add_slide(slide_layout)\n    title = slide.shapes.title\n    content = slide.placeholders[1]\n    \n    title.text = \"Technical Architecture\"\n    content.text = (\n        \"\u2022 Modular agent framework with specialized capabilities\\n\"\n        \"\u2022 Support for multiple LLM providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, etc.)\\n\"\n        